+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a new :class:`~qiskit_machine_learning.kernels.algorithms.QuantumKernelTrainer`
+    that optimizes the user parameters of a
+    :class:`~qiskit_machine_learning.kernels.QuantumKernel` against labeled training data
+    using a kernel loss function and an optimizer. The trainer returns a
+    :class:`~qiskit_machine_learning.kernels.algorithms.QuantumKernelTrainerResult` that
+    exposes the optimizer metadata and an optimized copy of the quantum kernel. The input
+    quantum kernel is not mutated by training.
+  - |
+    Added a :class:`~qiskit_machine_learning.utils.loss_functions.KernelLoss` abstract base
+    class defining the callable and ``evaluate`` contract for kernel loss functions, and an
+    :class:`~qiskit_machine_learning.utils.loss_functions.SVCLoss` implementation that fits a
+    support vector classifier on the evaluated kernel matrix and returns the classification
+    error. ``SVCLoss`` forwards keyword arguments to :class:`sklearn.svm.SVC`.
